# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# v3.1.0 — No environment variables required.
#
# PDF generation is fully client-side (jsPDF + html2pdf.js).
# Serverless Chromium was removed — Vercel's free-tier runtime
# lacks libnss3.so which Chromium requires at the system level.
#
# If you upgrade to Vercel Pro and want to restore serverless
# PDF generation, see git history for api/warm-up.js and
# api/resume-pdf.js, and restore @sparticuz/chromium package.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
